## Preserve OWL labels and language tags

Context: OWL imports discarded language tags from consumed RDFS labels and
comments, and imported ontology names ignored the ontology header label.
Preserve this metadata through parsing and generation.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/w3c/owl/OntologyParser.py
   Capture language tags for ontology, class, and property labels and comments.
2. src/back/core/w3c/owl/OntologyGenerator.py
   Emit language-tagged ontology, class, and property labels and comments.
3. src/back/objects/ontology/OntologyOwl.py
   Forward the ontology label language to the OWL generator.
4. src/back/objects/ontology/OntologyImport.py
   Prefer the ontology header label when resolving the imported ontology name
   and persist ontology-level label/comment language tags in the domain config.
5. tests/units/ontology/test_owl_parser.py
   Cover language-tag capture for consumed RDFS literals.
6. tests/units/ontology/test_ontology_service.py
   Cover ontology header label precedence and import-to-generation language
   tag persistence.
7. tests/units/ontology/test_owl_import_fidelity.py
   Forward the parsed header label language in the issue #194 round trip.

